                         "actionTaken":  "\"Actions taken: Secured and informed to Divisional incharge /MYS and closed the unit\nusing hydraulic and mechanical jacks and wooden blocks manually, unit locked at 08:30Hrs, \u0026 cleared at 08.47Hrs. Replaced damaged adapter with the class 2 adapter available in the machine. M/c made ready at 14.10 Hrs .   \"",
                         "breakdownTime":  "2026-09-21",
