                         "defectFamily":  "",
                         "description":  "Date of failure: 21.09.2026\nBlock Section  : JRU - SLU D/L:\nBlock Time  : 04.10-07.40 hrs\nMachine cleared time : 08.47 hrs\nCategory: Mechanical \nDescription of failure:  At 07:35 while closing the machine, hose adapter of RHS\nsweeping unit lifting/lowering cylinder got broken and unit fell down.",
                         "division":  "MYS",
                         "downHours":  0,
                         "fitTime":  "2026-11-21",
                         "id":  "INC-FRM1889-6620",
                         "isRepetitive":  false,
                         "machineNo":  "FRM-1889",
                         "natureOfFailure":  "Date of failure: 21.09.2026\nBlock Section  : JRU - SLU D/L:\nBlock Time  : 04.10-07.40 hrs\nMachine cleared time : 08.47 hrs\nCategory: Mechanical \nDescription of failure:  At 07:35 while closing the machine, hose adapter of RHS\nsweeping unit lifting/lowering cylinder got broken and unit fell down.",
                         "partNo":  "-",
                         "remarks":  "\"The hose adapter of the RHS sweeping unit lifting/lowering cylinder fractured at the neck portion while closing the machine. On inspection, the material at the neck portion was found to have become weak, resulting in fracture. The neck portion is the weakest section of the adapter and is subjected to repeated operational loading, which may lead to crack initiation and eventual failure.  The damaged adapter was replaced with a Class-II adapter available on the machine, and the RHS sweeping unit was secured and restored to normal working condition. The failure is assessed as material fatigue/weakening at the neck portion of the hose adapter.\"",
                         "repeatCount":  1,
                         "repetitiveReason":  "",
