                         "natureOfFailure":  "Block Time : 06:20 to 09:20 hrs. \n  Machine cleared time : 08:45 hrs\n  Section: CTA Yd Rd 2 M/L\n  Category:Pneumatic\n  Description: After working of 50mtrs pneumatic working system automatically stopped buzzer indication came , observed that pneumatic pressure is not building up, after ramp out closed the work and clear the line block at 08:45 hrs .",
                         "partNo":  "-",
                         "remarks":  "\"The root cause of the failure was sticking of the spool in the 90346 pneumatic CL-II valve due to emulsion formation caused by moisture ingress into the pneumatic system, resulting in failure of pneumatic pressure build-up. The working condition of the air dryer was checked and found satisfactory. The faulty pneumatic valve was replaced with the available Class-II spare, and the machine was made ready for the next day\u0027s working. The affected valve was subsequently cleaned and kept as a spare.  Preventive Action: The functioning of the air dryer and pneumatic system shall be checked\"",
