                         "partNo":  "-",
                         "remarks":  "\"On 09.09.2026, during the line block at HBS Yard, Road No. 2, the LH tamping bank hydraulic distribution block bracket was found broken. The machine completed the block and cleared the section at 02:00 hrs. The bracket was welded on the same day and the machine was made ready by 12:00 hrs. One spare distribution block bracket was also issued to the machine from ZBD/YPR.  UNI-8277 has experienced multiple tamping bank failures after POH. The existing tamping bank was of CPOH/RYP make and was commissioned on 12.12.2025 after the 4th POH of the machine at CPOH/RYP, which was completed on 28.11.2025. The CPOH warranty of the tamping bank was for 600 units/6 months and expired on 12.06.2026.  Considering the repeated failures of the tamping bank and the recurrence of component failures, the issue is suspected to be related to the material/structural quality of the tamping bank components. As a preventive measure, a new tamping bank has been demanded for replacement of the existing bank.\"",
                         "repeatCount":  1,
