                                           "fullTxt":  "during the movement from kag (left kag:- 11:05 hrs) to slu at 11:25 hrs abnormal sound occurred. then immediately stopped the m/c and checked the engine. and found idler pulley\u0027s bearing of radiator fan belt has broken. cleared the section at myk at 11:29 hrs. mechanical component during the movement from kag (left kag:- 11:05 hrs) to slu at 11:25 hrs abnormal sound occurred. then immediately stopped the m/c and checked the engine. and found idler pulley\u0027s bearing of radiator fan belt has broken. cleared the section at myk at 11:29 hrs.  bearing (od-80mm, id-35mm, thickness -35mm) arranged from local market and fixed. machine ready 17:00 hrs; further block not permitted. - bearing (od-80mm, id-35mm, thickness -35mm) arranged from local market and fixed. machine ready 17:00 hrs; further block not permitted.",
