                         "actionTaken":  "The work was stopped immediately and checked the outer tamping bank for any other damages. After observation, ramp out was given after locking RH outer tamping bank \u0026 cleared the section at 00.06 hrs. The machine can be made ready for working only after receipt and replacement of the required material. The material for the vibration shaft sub-assembly has been requested from HSPL. On 04.09.2026, Waiting for material. The HSPL service engineer, Mr. Sushil, is available with the machine. According to the Service Manager, Manish, the vibration shaft assembly has been dispatched from the HSPL warehouse in New Delhi. They will send the assembly by air to Bangalore through courier service. On 05.09.2026, Waiting for material. The material has been dispatched from New Delhi by air and is expected to be received on 06.09.2026 at ZBD/YPR. On 06.09.2026, Waiting for material, it has not yet been received at ZBD/YPR. Complete dismantling of the RH Outer Tamping Bank vibration shaft has been completed. On 07.09.2026, The required material was received at ZBD/YPR at 13:00 hrs. Thereafter, the material was dispatched to KIGL by 2-ton vehicle and received at site at 15:30 hrs. Assembly work commenced at 16:00 hrs. On 08.09.2026, the complete RH Outer Tamping Bank vibration shaft assembly was assembled and checked. The machine was tested(01:10hrs) and found to be working satisfactorily. M/c made ready for working.",
