                                           "fullTxt":  "category: pneumatic\nblock section: sspn-bspl\nblock time: 14.20-15.20 hrs\nduring clearing of block, at 15.15 hrs, driving mode not engaging. checking the issue at site, manually engaged the gear box \u0026 clear the section sspn @ 15.50 pneumatic component category: pneumatic\nblock section: sspn-bspl\nblock time: 14.20-15.20 hrs\nduring clearing of block, at 15.15 hrs, driving mode not engaging. checking the issue at site, manually engaged the gear box \u0026 clear the section sspn @ 15.50  \"replaced the pneumatic valve -90344 which controls the drive engaging \u0026 dis engaging pneumatic cylinder, \u0026 cleared the scetion at sspn at 15.50hrs\nthe defective pneumatic valve no. 90344 was replaced.\n\nthe el-t 1163 pcb was temporarily bypassed to restore operation. similar pcbs had already been sent to plasser india for repair.\naxle no. 2 was opened and the damaged pinion gear assembly (part no. ssp70.01.602ae) was replaced on 27.10.2026.\n\nthe machine\u0027s grounding connections were also instructed to be checked and cleaned\" - \"replaced the pneumatic valve -90344 which controls the drive engaging \u0026 dis engaging pneumatic cylinder, \u0026 cleared the scetion at sspn at 15.50hrs\nthe defective pneumatic valve no. 90344 was replaced.\n\nthe el-t 1163 pcb was temporarily bypassed to restore operation. similar pcbs had already been sent to plasser india for repair.\naxle no. 2 was opened and the damaged pinion gear assembly (part no. ssp70.01.602ae) was replaced on 27.10.2026.\n\nthe machine\u0027s grounding connections were also instructed to be checked and cleaned\"",
