                         "description":  "Date of failure:25.10.2026\nBlock Section-BSN-RDI\nBlock Time - 03:00-05:00 hrs, cleared at 05:15 hrs\nAfter 100 mtrs packing in 2 nd location between BSN-RDI,LH outer Tamping up/dn cylinder cut from frame.Mc closed@04:50 hrs.After pway manual packing, Mc  cleared RDI at 05:15 hrs.",
