                                           "fullTxt":  "block section \u0026 time: bwt - mkm; 00:15 to 03:00 hrs\n failure time: 02:10 hrs \n block cleared time:02:57 hrs at bwt\n category:mechanical \n description of failure: during working engine suddenly shutdown. found engine radiator fan not rotating. \n action taken: failure reason: during the line block between bwt and mkm single line, the line block was from 00:15 to 03:00 hrs. \nduring working at 02:10 hrs, the engine shut down, and upon inspection, it was found that the radiator fan was not rotating. the engine was restarted after adding water to the radiator fins. \nthe machine was then  locked and the section was cleared at bwt road 4 at 02:57 hrs. mechanical component block section \u0026 time: bwt - mkm; 00:15 to 03:00 hrs\n failure time: 02:10 hrs \n block cleared time:02:57 hrs at bwt\n category:mechanical \n description of failure: during working engine suddenly shutdown. found engine radiator fan not rotating. \n action taken: failure reason: during the line block between bwt and mkm single line, the line block was from 00:15 to 03:00 hrs. \nduring working at 02:10 hrs, the engine shut down, and upon inspection, it was found that the radiator fan was not rotating. the engine was restarted after adding water to the radiator fins. \nthe machine was then  locked and the section was cleared at bwt road 4 at 02:57 hrs.  action taken: at siding, checked cooling pump (double pump) outputs and found no discharge of oil and found that zf cooler fan, hydraulic cooler fans also not rotating. requires cooling pump(part no: hy806x.20.14li and zf mounting accessories. opened the cooling pump and found that pump shaft, coupler and bearing all got worn out. bearings has been arranged from coimbatore \u0026 is expected to reach on monday(26.10.2026) \u0026 shaft is not available in zbd/ypr \u0026 has been arranged from ryp which will be dispacted on monday(26.10.2026). on 25.10.2026, waiting for materials. on 26.10.2026, the bearing from coimbatore arrived at 16:00 hrs. on 27.10.2026, bearing fixed to the carrier at zbd/ypr and reached machine at 12:50 hrs. carrier housing removed from zf gear box. assembled the carrier on the housing. fixed the housing to zf. fixed the cooling pump. machine tested; all cooling fans and radiator fan working properly. systems found satisfactory, and the machine is ready at 17.45 hrs for the night block. - action taken: at siding, checked cooling pump (double pump) outputs and found no discharge of oil and found that zf cooler fan, hydraulic cooler fans also not rotating. requires cooling pump(part no: hy806x.20.14li and zf mounting accessories. opened the cooling pump and found that pump shaft, coupler and bearing all got worn out. bearings has been arranged from coimbatore \u0026 is expected to reach on monday(26.10.2026) \u0026 shaft is not available in zbd/ypr \u0026 has been arranged from ryp which will be dispacted on monday(26.10.2026). on 25.10.2026, waiting for materials. on 26.10.2026, the bearing from coimbatore arrived at 16:00 hrs. on 27.10.2026, bearing fixed to the carrier at zbd/ypr and reached machine at 12:50 hrs. carrier housing removed from zf gear box. assembled the carrier on the housing. fixed the housing to zf. fixed the cooling pump. machine tested; all cooling fans and radiator fan working properly. systems found satisfactory, and the machine is ready at 17.45 hrs for the night block.",
                                           "primaryTxt":  "block section \u0026 time: bwt - mkm; 00:15 to 03:00 hrs\n failure time: 02:10 hrs \n block cleared time:02:57 hrs at bwt\n category:mechanical \n description of failure: during working engine suddenly shutdown. found engine radiator fan not rotating. \n action taken: failure reason: during the line block between bwt and mkm single line, the line block was from 00:15 to 03:00 hrs. \nduring working at 02:10 hrs, the engine shut down, and upon inspection, it was found that the radiator fan was not rotating. the engine was restarted after adding water to the radiator fins. \nthe machine was then  locked and the section was cleared at bwt road 4 at 02:57 hrs. mechanical component block section \u0026 time: bwt - mkm; 00:15 to 03:00 hrs\n failure time: 02:10 hrs \n block cleared time:02:57 hrs at bwt\n category:mechanical \n description of failure: during working engine suddenly shutdown. found engine radiator fan not rotating. \n action taken: failure reason: during the line block between bwt and mkm single line, the line block was from 00:15 to 03:00 hrs. \nduring working at 02:10 hrs, the engine shut down, and upon inspection, it was found that the radiator fan was not rotating. the engine was restarted after adding water to the radiator fins. \nthe machine was then  locked and the section was cleared at bwt road 4 at 02:57 hrs."
