                         "actionTaken":  "Action taken: At siding, checked Cooling pump (Double pump) outputs and found no discharge of oil and found that ZF cooler fan, Hydraulic cooler fans also not rotating. Requires Cooling pump(Part No: HY806X.20.14LI and ZF mounting accessories. Opened the Cooling pump and found that pump shaft, coupler and bearing all got worn out. Bearings has been arranged from coimbatore \u0026 is expected to reach on Monday(26.10.2026) \u0026 shaft is not available in ZBD/YPR \u0026 has been arranged from RYP which will be dispacted on Monday(26.10.2026). On 25.10.2026, Waiting for materials. On 26.10.2026, the bearing from Coimbatore arrived at 16:00 hrs. On 27.10.2026, Bearing fixed to the carrier at ZBD/YPR and reached machine at 12:50 hrs. Carrier housing removed from ZF Gear box. Assembled the carrier on the housing. Fixed the housing to ZF. Fixed the cooling pump. Machine tested; all cooling fans and radiator fan working properly. Systems found satisfactory, and the machine is ready at 17.45 hrs for the night block.",
