                         "status":  "FIT",
                         "stepsTaken":  "\"* Checked all the input sensors of the  work drive mode found okay.\n* Checked the supply from  pressure switch of the working cabin \u0026 front cabin brake unit also found okay.\n* Upon checking found that the input from the pressure switch 1F6  is not coming from B-94 panel to working cabin B-7, Open the B94 panel found that the loose connection of the input of Pressure switch. Re tighten the input wire at B94 panel .\n* Check the machine working, found satisfactory.Machine ready for line block attention at 22.30hrs.\"",
