                         "actionTaken":  "Action taken: Booked OEPL Service engineer regarding belt pasting work. 3 mtrs Discharged conveyor belt send to machine. Waiting for belt pasting team to attend it. On 11.10.2026, conveyor belt available in STMRD/UBL is expected to reach the machine on 12.10.2026 morning. On 12.10.2026,conveyor belt from STMRD/UBL received at M/c.Waiting for OEPL SE \u0026 pasting person. On 13.10.2026, OEPL SE attended M/c and dimantled the discharge conveyer belt completely. On 14.10.2026, Discharge conveyor belt pasting done \u0026 m/c made ready at 15.30 hrs",
