                         "actionTaken":  "\"Screening work was stopped immediately after failure of the waste conveyor belt.\n\nThe MDU machine was detached, all units were closed and the block was cleared.\n\nThe waste conveyor belt is to be repaired by pasting to restore its working condition.\n\nConsidering the condition of the waste conveyor belt, transfer conveyor belt and associated assembly, the machine was planned for POH attention at CPOH/RYP.\n\nThe machine was sent to CPOH/RYP for comprehensive POH attention.\"",
                         "breakdownTime":  "2026-10-04",
