                         "partNo":  "-",
                         "remarks":  "the failure occurred due to three issues: (i) the 90346 pneumatic system valve got stuck due to moisture ingress, affecting the trolley UP/DOWN movement; (ii) the pneumatic system pressure switch became faulty, affecting the work drive; and (iii) a power supply issue to the hydraulic valve of the vibration unit UP/DOWN cylinder. The issues were rectified by cleaning the pneumatic valve, replacing the faulty pressure switch, and interchanging the QL PCB, respectively.",
